cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. If you use the data, also cite the NCSES HERD Survey."
title: "HERD Explorer"
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/nate-layman/herd-explorer"
authors:
  - family-names: Layman
    given-names: Nathan
    affiliation: "University of Idaho"
abstract: >-
  Browser-based explorer for the NCSES Higher Education Research and Development (HERD) Survey.
  Compare institutions, states and groups over time, roll up to national figures, pivot the
  institution-level data any way you like, project trends with a hierarchical model, and
  download the combined data. Runs entirely in the browser on GitHub Pages.
references:
  - type: data
    title: "Higher Education Research and Development (HERD) Survey, institution-level microdata"
    authors:
      - name: "National Center for Science and Engineering Statistics, U.S. National Science Foundation"
    url: "https://ncses.nsf.gov/explore-data/microdata/higher-education-research-development"
